        "spans_beyond_this_verse": false,
        "text": "The twenty-four are the letters in Gayatri hymn. Ramayana's scheming is based on Gayatri hymn and for this: atra caturvi~Nshatisa~Nkhyo uktyaa caturvi~NshatyakSharagaayatrii tulyataa suucitaa | prathamaadhyaaye - tapaHsvaadhyaaya - ityatra prathamam takaarasya - sargaante - mahatvamiiyaat -- ityatra yaat - iti akSharasya grahaNaat api gaayatriiruupatvam suucitam - dharmaakuutam"
      }
    ],
